# The changelog is append-only inside [Unreleased]; every branch adds bullets in
# the same place, so a plain three-way merge conflicts on nearly every PR.
# `merge=union` keeps both sides' lines instead of raising a conflict. Re-read
# the [Unreleased] section after a merge: order is not guaranteed and duplicate
# bullets are possible, so tidy it when cutting a release.
CHANGELOG.md merge=union
